      "comment": "Keen to see the regally bred CHANDLER (2) step out again. He had no luck on debut at Cranbourne then went to Ballarat and bolted in from the front in very fast time as the $1.30 favourite. Put up a strong rating there and a repeat or improvement sees him win again. COVERT ACTION (4) resumes off two trials and boasts good form last time in, winning well on debut then tackling a handy race at Flemington. Wary off a short break, watch betting. YEAH RIGHT (5) slots in for third on resumption, he was close up at Cranbourne before a break. DIAMOND MILA (8) has been contesting easier races, he looks most likely to finish fourth.",
